Search conversation uploads, Project files, Project knowledge, and allowed Library files with ranked semantic search. Project-backed files stay on scope.surfaces=['conversation'] and report source_kind='project'; use scope.surfaces=['library'] only for allowed Library search. Indexed connector-synced Project docs may appear as Project file results. For current Drive bytes, downloads, or exports, use an available live Google Drive connector with a user-supplied exact Drive URL or file ID, or a verified Project cloud_doc_url.

For visual questions, inspect relevant images before answering. When `image()` is available, emit relevant images and citations from the result `r` in the same `functions.exec` call as retrieval:
```js
for (const result of r.results ?? []) {
  for (const part of result.image_asset_pointers ?? []) {
    if (typeof part === "string") {
      text(part);
    } else if (part?.content_type === "image_asset_pointer" && part.image_url) {
      image(part); text(part.citation_marker);
    }
  }
}
```
`text(...)` alone does not display images. If visual evidence is needed but search has no usable image, use `tools.files__read` to inspect the relevant file or pages.

